---
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<section class="section how-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="kicker">Start watching together</p><h2 id="how-title">Three steps to movie night.</h2></div>
    <p>Already have Jellyfin? Your administrator sets up OpenWatchParty once. Then everyone joins from Jellyfin Web.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps">
    <a class="step" style="--accent:#27c8f7" href={withBase('/product/first-watch-party/#path-b-existing-jellyfin')}>
      <span class="step-number">01 — Admin</span>
      <h3>Set up the party</h3>
      <p>Install the plugin and session server. The guided setup walks your Jellyfin administrator through it.</p>
      <span class="step-link">Setup instructions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="step" style="--accent:#8fa6f8" href={withBase('/product/first-watch-party/#host-create-a-room')}>
      <span class="step-number">02 — Host</span>
      <h3>Start a video</h3>
      <p>Open a film or episode in Jellyfin Web, select <strong>Watch Party</strong>, and create a room.</p>
      <span class="step-link">Host steps <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
    <a class="step" style="--accent:#c29bff" href={withBase('/product/first-watch-party/#guest-find-and-join-the-room')}>
      <span class="step-number">03 — Guests</span>
      <h3>Bring your people in</h3>
      <p>Friends sign in to the same Jellyfin server and join your room or open your invite link. Playback lines up automatically.</p>
      <span class="step-link">Guest steps <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="steps-note">Everyone needs a Jellyfin account and access to the same media. Each person streams from Jellyfin on their own device.</p>
</section>
